		{"id":"34d50c5d2c82f3cc","type":"group","x":1140,"y":110,"width":1060,"height":540,"label":"Infrastructure"},
		{"id":"ff63d9aa22e774eb","type":"group","x":2960,"y":-1520,"width":880,"height":540,"label":"Config"},
		{
			"id":"29faae8e8d9792be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Agents and AI Tools",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1160,
			"y":-790,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"be6a5cc9149d21d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Agents can be Human or AI\n- Agents are GURPS compatible\n- Agents can have a Character Sheet\n- Agents can have a Role\n- Agents can be attached to a Project\n- Agents can have a Parent\n- Agents can have Tools attached\n- Agents can be displayed in a 2D world with ExcaliburJS\n- ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1160,
			"y":-690,
			"width":380,
			"height":340
		},
		{"id":"4d8f11b15f948a59","type":"file","file":"03 - Resources/Reports/Project Summary.md","x":1160,"y":-1480,"width":400,"height":470},
		{"id":"175788db73a5456b","type":"file","file":"01 - Projects/Flowti CLI/Flowti CLI PRD.md","x":1600,"y":-1480,"width":400,"height":470},
		{
			"id":"a47fcc4fc080a702",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Areas",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2020,
			"y":-130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c4e2a47882df58c0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Lifecycle",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2020,
			"y":-210,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cccddda8e8fc4013",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sitemap",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1160,
			"y":130,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"44109fe26c50af0d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Components",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2760,
			"y":-790,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"db9f62acec776bf3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Projects",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1600,
			"y":-790,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c286a5d5127c8a11",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Requirements",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2320,
			"y":-790,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ae15adbd45107a26",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Event Catalog",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3220,
			"y":-790,
			"width":380,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"09904acb9c23952e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- follow the IREB standard\n- are managed in a project\n- are managed in a backlog\n- have a lifecycle\n- can have tasks\n- can have a parent\n- have a complexity score evaluated from dependencies and scope\n- can be evaluated in complexity like the codebase\n- can have tests attached\n- can be tested",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":-690,
			"width":380,
			"height":500
		},
		{
			"id":"db2bfa00530a8e4b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- drives the ui\n- enables declarative ui\n- contains components\n- follows PageObject pattern\n- is storybook compatible",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1160,
			"y":230,
			"width":380,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"75dc7ce15dd59315",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- are json definitions\n- are storybook compatible\n- are testable\n- are visualizable\n- follow HTML standards\n- are self-contained\n- can have events\n- can receive events\n- can access stores\n- can have actions\n- follow PageObject pattern\n- are C4-Model compatible\n- can showcase a system\n- can simulate a system\n- are ECS compatible",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2760,
			"y":-690,
			"width":380,
			"height":500
		},
		{
			"id":"a4011e654890765f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- are executed in iterations\n- document time, function, budget, quality\n- time is start and end or estimated dates\n- function is deliverables and requirements\n- budget is money\n- quality in regards of ISO 9001 and ISO 25010 (can be expandend or loosen)\n- report on their iterations and their overall status\n- Projects can have Agents\n- Projects plan with Resources\n- Projects can have Tasks\n- Iterations are Tasks\n- Projects document themselves automatically\n- Projects can follow different frameworks, such as Prince2, Scrum, PMI, DIN 69901, or p3.express, or a combination of those\n- Projects can have phases\n- Phases can be managed agile, waterfall, hybrid\n- Projects can have Goals\n- Projects produce Products\n- Projects produce Product Increments",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":-690,
			"width":380,
			"height":660
		},
		{
			"id":"c1ab917a34f8cb90",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"SBOM",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"7ecfef96219b6755","type":"file","file":"01 - Projects/Flowti CLI/Flowti CLI Architecture.md","x":2040,"y":-1480,"width":400,"height":470},
		{
			"id":"3f72ee99ea639f31",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Requirements\n\n- Domain Driven Design\n- Clean Architecture\n- Dependency Injection\n- Declarative UI\n- Test Driven Development\n- Clean Code Development\n- OWASP Best Practices\n- Self-documenting\n- Self-reporting\n- Data-Driven\n- ECS Compatible\n- ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2480,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":400,
			"height":470
		},
		{
			"id":"6e44cc51a12b9666",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- shows all available events in a system\n- is C4-Model compatible\n- knows the following event kinds: command, query, event\n- can manage Domains, Services, Events\n- can be used for event-storming\n- can be used to connect systems visually\n- can be used to visualize systems",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3220,
			"y":-690,
			"width":380,
			"height":500
		},
		{"id":"b65159a7afec5752","type":"file","file":"01 - Projects/Flowti CLI/configs/flowti.config.json","x":2980,"y":-1480,"width":400,"height":470},
